<title>POLAND: Polish bourse kerb bond deals - November 29.</title>
<headline>Polish bourse kerb bond deals - November 29.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerb trade through the Warsaw bourse on Friday saw 2,100 fixed-interest five-year bonds maturing on October 12, 2001 trading at 81.45 zlotys.</p>
<p>Their turnover was 1.7 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
